    "Id": "mechdef_haze_HAZ-B",
    "Name": "Haze B",
    "Details": "The B configuration of the Haze OmniMech relies on four iATM-3 launchers, spread over the side torsos and the left arm, as its main weapons. An Improved Heavy Medium Laser in the right arm and a Flamer add close-range firepower, while a Nova CEWS and a Remote Sensor Dispenser make it highly capable at reconnaissance and at guarding the flanks of friendly forces. The thick Ferro-Lamellor armor every Haze carries helps it survive while scouting ahead.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Haze"
  },
